  "details": "I'm trying out playing VRC being streamed from my PC to my Steam Frame\n\nI tried editing a keybind in the SteamVR menu, changing B from the default udon menu action to Gesture Toggle. When I changed it and closed the Steam menu, pressing B would both use Gesture Toggle and still open the main menu.\n\nAlso, I don't know if this is a VRC level bug or a SteamVR bug, but after closing the Steam menu after setting that keybind, reopening the Steam menu caused the laser pointing to be inaccurate. Like, I had to point a little bit away from the button I wanted to actually click on in order to do it.",
